Lift the tank lid up and away from the toilet tank.

Shut off the stop valve underneath the toilet by turning it clockwise until it becomes hand tight.

The appearance of this valve may differ from toilet to toilet, but most operate the same. Some valves require multiple turns to stop the water while others only require a quarter turn.

Push down the flush lever.

Hold the lever down until water stops draining from the tank.

A small amount of water will remain in the bottom of the tank.

If the flush lever or pull chain have become disconnected, lift up the toilet flapper to drain the tank.

Squeeze open the spring clasp that connects the pull chain to the tank lever.

Disconnect the spring clasp from the tank lever.

Disconnect the flapper from the posts on each side of the overflow tube.

Remove the flapper from the toilet tank.', 203, 'https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Toilet+Flapper+Replacement/44146', NULL, '{"license": "CC-BY-NC-SA-3.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/", "rights_status": null, "rights_url": null, "usage_status": "project_noncommercial_status_unconfirmed"}', '{"id": "44146", "group": "ifixit", "title_zh": "更换马桶排水阀片", "title": "Toilet Flapper Replacement", "english_words": 203, "characters_with_whitespace": 1150, "characters_without_whitespace": 937, "steps": 5, "source_url": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Toilet+Flapper+Replacement/44146", "text_path": "texts/44146.txt", "source_metadata": {"category": "toilet_flapper", "guide_id": 44146, "api_url": "https://www.ifixit.com/api/2.0/guides/44146", "status": "success", "quality_accepted": false, "knowledge_base_imported": false, "usage_approved": false, "license": "CC-BY-NC-SA-3.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/", "usage_status": "project_noncommercial_status_unconfirmed", "record_type": "repair_guide_not_work_order", "source_url": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Toilet+Flapper+Replacement/44146", "title": "Toilet Flapper Replacement", "author": {"userid": 1020837, "username": "Kristen Gismondi", "unique_username": "kristen", "join_date": 1415817321, "image": {"id": 5496915, "guid": "BCARRlVWyqbrI13Z", "mini": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/BCARRlVWyqbrI13Z.mini", "thumbnail": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/BCARRlVWyqbrI13Z.thumbnail", "140x105": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/BCARRlVWyqbrI13Z.140x105", "200x150": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/BCARRlVWyqbrI13Z.200x150", "standard": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/BCARRlVWyqbrI13Z.standard", "440x330": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/BCARRlVWyqbrI13Z.440x330", "medium": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/BCARRlVWyqbrI13Z.medium", "original": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/BCARRlVWyqbrI13Z.full"}, "