Locate the plastic hinge covers at the back of the lid.
Open both hinges by curling your fingers underneath the plastic overhang at the back of the hinge and pulling straight up. You will now be able to move your toilet seat.
With a firm grasp on either side of the toilet seat, pull straight forwards so that the seat slides off the toilet bowl.', '{"step_id": 281190, "order": 1, "title": "", "lines": [{"text_raw": "Make sure your toilet lid is in the closed position.", "bullet": "black", "level": 0, "lineid": null, "text_rendered": "Make sure your toilet lid is in the closed position."}, {"text_raw": "Locate the plastic hinge covers at the back of the lid.", "bullet": "black", "level": 0, "lineid": null, "text_rendered": "Locate the plastic hinge covers at the back of the lid."}, {"text_raw": "Open both hinges by curling your fingers underneath the plastic overhang at the back of the hinge and pulling straight up. You will now be able to move your toilet seat.", "bullet": "black", "level": 0, "lineid": null, "text_rendered": "Open both hinges by curling your fingers underneath the plastic overhang at the back of the hinge and pulling straight up. You will now be able to move your toilet seat."}, {"text_raw": "With a firm grasp on either side of the toilet seat, pull straight forwards so that the seat slides off the toilet bowl.", "bullet": "black", "level": 0, "lineid": null, "text_rendered": "With a firm grasp on either side of the toilet seat, pull straight forwards so that the seat slides off the toilet bowl."}]}') ON CONFLICT (document_id, step_number) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title, body=EXCLUDED.body, metadata=EXCLUDED.metadata;

Locate the hinge assembly towards the back of the toilet seat.
