Using your needle-nose pliers, pinch one of the dampers and pull it halfway out of its compartment, or until the damper no longer connects the hinge assembly to the toilet seat.
Do the same to the other damper.
With both dampers still in their compartments, remove the hinge assembly from the toilet seat.', '{"step_id": 281195, "order": 3, "title": "", "lines": [{"text_raw": "Locate the cylindrical dampers on either side of the hinge assembly.", "bullet": "black", "level": 0, "lineid": null, "text_rendered": "Locate the cylindrical dampers on either side of the hinge assembly."}, {"text_raw": "Using your needle-nose pliers, pinch one of the dampers and pull it halfway out of its compartment, or until the damper no longer connects the hinge assembly to the toilet seat.", "bullet": "black", "level": 0, "lineid": null, "text_rendered": "Using your needle-nose pliers, pinch one of the dampers and pull it halfway out of its compartment, or until the damper no longer connects the hinge assembly to the toilet seat."}, {"text_raw": "Do the same to the other damper.", "bullet": "black", "level": 0, "lineid": null, "text_rendered": "Do the same to the other damper."}, {"text_raw": "With both dampers still in their compartments, remove the hinge assembly from the toilet seat.", "bullet": "black", "level": 0, "lineid": null, "text_rendered": "With both dampers still in their compartments, remove the hinge assembly from the toilet seat."}]}') ON CONFLICT (document_id, step_number) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title, body=EXCLUDED.body, metadata=EXCLUDED.metadata;

