 through the pipe. I''ve been using a plunger when it was getting clogged (snake was ineffective). A plumber had told me in the past, that the problem is deep inside the wall (about 3 meters into the pipe) and is very hard to fix. He also suggested using NaOH a couple of times a year to keep it clean. Top view and side view respectively:", "display_label": "排水不畅", "label_basis": "reported_symptom_context", "demo_status": "待维修（演示设定）", "demo_status_is_synthetic": true, "actual_work_order": false, "diagnosis_confirmed": false, "source_url": "https://diy.stackexchange.com/questions/100038/sink-clogged-completely-when-using-naoh-drain-cleaner", "image_url": "https://i.sstatic.net/jOeY2.png", "author": "Petko.Maria.John", "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/", "image_rights_status": "not_independently_verified", "source_record_file": "D:\\project\\Safescan_agent\\data\\collection-pilot\\indoor-repair-20261009\\clean.json", "source_image_path": "D:\\project\\Safescan_agent\\data\\collection-pilot\\indoor-repair-20261009\\media\\000\\09.png", "review_note": "水槽或排水管照片；排水不畅依据原帖，照片不能确认堵塞原因。", "local_path": "images/indoor-100038-1.png", "sha256": "ec9f68462398bdf81d12570d233cc6d5638e39ebda77975c1dada86de168111c", "country": null}}, {"file": "indoor-repair-20261009\\media\\000\\outcomes.json", "record": {"id": "100038-1", "question_id": 100038, "category": "drain_blockage", "kind": "image", "url": "https://i.sstatic.net/jOeY2.png", "alt": "enter image description here", "source_url": "https://diy.stackexchange.com/questions/100038/sink-clogged-completely-when-using-naoh-drain-cleaner", "role": "reported_fault_context_candidate", "status": "success", "rights_status": "unknown", "width": 224, "height": 186, "final_url": "https://i.sstatic.net/jOeY2.png", "local_path": "09.png", "sha256": "ec9f68462398bdf81d12570d233cc6d5638e39ebda77975c1dada86de168111c", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-09T08:52:17.892622+00:00"}}]}') ON CONFLI