ion": "Share with friends or make new ones in our shared apartments that give you the freedom to enjoy large living areas with the privacy of your own 12m2 ensuite bedroom - located from level 2 to 11. Our 6 Bedroom Multi-Share Apartment features: - 55 inch TV in the lounge area - 2 x 2 seater sofas and a coffee table - Each bedroom comes with ensuite - Study desk with chair and lamp in each private ensuite bedroom - Built in wardrobe in each private ensuite bedroom - Kitchen with a 4-burner stovetop, microwave, dishwasher an oven - Dining table and chairs - 1 x French Door Fridge - Individual kitchen pantries with a resettable 4-digit lock - Shared kitchen pantry - Reverse cycle heating and cooling Air-conditioner both in lounge area AND each ensuite bedroom - Individual electronic swipe card access to each ensuite bedrooms - Shared common space of 28m2 What is included in my rent? • Weekly Rent is per person • Residential Life Program Membership • Water usage • Electricity usage • Unlimited Wi-Fi Internet What is not included in my weekly rent? • Departure Clean Fee • Food • Study materials • Bed linen and kitchen equipment - you can buy these products & much more via our online shop (Your Shop) View Virtual Tour Note - Rental price is per person and all applicants must apply via booking engine Note - photos are display only and are not reflected as the actual apartment/room *Note - fridge sizes may vary. View Virtual Tour", "downloaded_assets": [{"id": "asset-f115622b6a27a80a", "url": "https://image-tc.galaxy.tf/wipng-apf4qigjpgw5srgh42iu2we9e/ul-melbourne-central-6-bedroom-apartment-floorplan_wide.png?crop=0%2C145%2C2000%2C1125&width=1920", "kind": "image", "rights_status": "unknown", "state": "success", "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "status": 200, "final_url": "https://image-tc.galaxy.tf/wipng-apf4qigjpgw5srgh42iu2we9e/ul-melbourne-central-6-bedroom-apartment-floorplan_wide.png?crop=0%2C145%2C2000%2C1125&width=1920", "sha256": "fe92bdc5de79632ad46fdab56c5868ae