iam-st-adelaide-sa-5000/9725089", "kind": "html", "discovery": "previous_web_search", "visual_status": "pending", "status": "success", "rights_status": "unknown", "final_url": "https://www.homely.com.au/homes/1903-411-king-william-st-adelaide-sa-5000/9725089", "local_path": "00.html", "sha256": "1b90303e1535f4fa3da44dd69a2434f2117d0dcce7485f92a19b84084b682c03", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-01T13:57:14.473335+00:00", "quality_accepted": false, "release_approved": false, "address": "1903/411 King William St, Adelaide SA 5000", "property_type": "Apartment", "description": "The Phone Code for this property is: 28505. Please quote this number when phoning or texting. Please submit an enquiry to receive a link to the Application Form. This apartment brings you luxury, lifestyle, and convenience in the city. Located right across the road from beautiful parklands as well as a free tram stop right on the elevator doors, it offers a spacious bedroom, light filled kitchen, meals area & lounge, fully functional bathroom, laundry, study niche and a balcony. Car park included. Fully furnished, so you are worry free to move in! Why we love this home:  - Spectacular views of the stunning parklands and the hills rises, as well as the city itself from the bedroom, lounge and balcony - Sizeable bedroom with queen-size bed (matress included) and BIR  - Kitchen with gas cooktop, concealed fridge/freezer and dish washer, with tiled and glass splash backs and s/steel appliances - Large bathroom with enclosed frameless shower - Hide-away separate laundry, including a washer, sink & benchtop - A big balcony with gorgeous views of the parklands - Split system air conditioning - NBN ready - Sony LED TV - Intercom with fob key entry, very secure - 1 secure & private carpark on Level 3 - Free of charge to use gym, swimming pool and the BBQ area on Level 7 - Bike rack on ground floor Tram services on the doorstep, Chinatown in walking distance, IGA around the corner, The Market Shed on Holland downstairs and parklands in the vicinity. It offers all the benefits of city living. This is where luxury meets convenience.  **SORRY NO PETS ALLOWED** The property will be available for inspection by appointment. Please book your inspection in advance. Photos are used to reflect the fixtures and fittings of the apartments only. Prospective tenants should make their own enquiries about the validity and accuracy of this information and view the property before making any leasing decisions. Disclaimer:  Whilst every care has been taken to verify the accuracy of the details in this advertisement, For Sale By Owner (forsalebyowner.com.au Pty Ltd) cannot guarantee its correctness. Prospective buyers or tenants need to take such action as is necessary, to satisfy themselves of any pertinent matters.", "offer": {"@type": "Offer", "priceCurrency": "AUD", "price": "$650", "url": "https://www.homely.com.au/homes/1903-411-king-william-st-adelaide-sa-5000/9725089"}, "page_title": "Leased Apartment 1903/411 King William St, Adelaide SA 5000 - Jun 25, 2026", "source_modified_at": "2026-06-25T11:36:30.835Z", "flags": ["historical_leased_not_current_offer"], "linked_media_count": 10, "linked_layout_count": 1}, "image_count": 10}') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET dataset_type=EXCLUDED.dataset_type, name=EXCLUDED.name, city=EXCLUDED.city, region=EXCLUDED.region, address=EXCLUDED.address, source_url=EXCLUDED.source_url, metadata=EXCLUDED.metadata;
