nsuite, while the main bathroom services the remaining 2 bedrooms. Secure building access and lift facilities add to the convenience and peace of mind of apartment living. Located in the thriving East End of the city, you''ll enjoy being just moments from Rundle Street boutique shopping, dining and entertainment, and Hutt Street amenities including cafés, restaurants, healthcare, pharmacies, and everyday services.  Features you''ll love: * Luxury, lifestyle living * 3 Queen-sized bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes * Master suite with luxe ensuite * Spacious open plan living with stunning parkland backdrop * Stunning entertainers'' kitchen, complete with high quality Miele appliances * Reverse cycle air conditioning & ceiling fans * Lovely wrap around alfresco terrace for entertaining, relaxing and enjoying the city lights * Separate European style laundry * High-speed fibre-optic and 5G connectivity * Double glazed windows & LED downlights throughout * Secure video intercom access into building and individual floors * 2 Secure off street carparks UNFURNISHED PROPERTY AVAILABLE FROM: 6th October 2026 WATER CHARGES: Tenant to pay supply and water usage APPLY: To apply for this property head to the Tenant Options website and find the property on our list of available rental properties. All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property''s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition) Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal advice.", "offer": {"@type": "Offer", "priceCurrency": "AUD", "price": "$1,000", "url": "https://www.homely.com.au/homes/1208-297-pirie-street-adelaide-sa-5000/13551672", "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock"}, "page_title": "1208/297 Pirie Street, Adelaide SA 5000 - Apartment For Rent", "source_modified_at