rivate outdoor space, while upstairs accommodation provides separation and privacy. Whether you’re relocating, working nearby, or simply want a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, this property is ready to go from day one. The Jumpers know you’ll like the following features: •\tLight-filled open plan living and meals area connecting seamlessly to outdoor patio  •\tFunctional kitchen overlooking living space with ample storage  •\tThree well-proportioned bedrooms upstairs, including master with ensuite and walk-in robe  •\tCentral main bathroom servicing bedrooms plus additional downstairs powder room  •\tPrivate balcony off master bedroom  •\tSeparate laundry  •\tSecure garage with internal access, a rare find in this location  •\tLow-maintenance courtyard and outdoor entertaining area   •\tThoughtful two-level layout offering separation between living and sleeping zones  Enjoy being just moments from Melbourne Street, where caf&#233;s, restaurants, bars and boutique shopping create one of Adelaide’s most vibrant lifestyle hubs. Whether it’s your morning coffee, casual dining or weekend catch-ups, everything is within easy walking distance. Zoned for quality schooling including North Adelaide Primary and Adelaide High School, and within close proximity to leading universities and hospitals. Public transport and direct CBD access make commuting effortless, while parklands and Adelaide Oval are just a short stroll away.                                                                                                                                                                                                Lease Term - 12+ months Water Charges - All water usage and water supply APPLICATIONS accepted only through 2Apply, visit 2apply.com.au (a link will be sent to you after this open inspection) Furniture not included.", "offer": {"@type": "Offer", "priceCurrency": "AUD", "price": "$850", "url": "https://www.homely.com.au/homes/1-12-east-pallant-street-north-adelaide-sa-50/1