54+00:00", "quality_accepted": false, "release_approved": false, "address": "2 Fitzpatrick Street, South Melbourne VIC 3205", "property_type": "House", "description": "Luxuriate in the splendor of this meticulously renovated 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom residence boasting a double garage. Positioned in the coveted South Melbourne locale, mere moments from Melbourne CBD, Crown Casino, Grand Prix Venue, South Melbourne Market, and the Beach, this home is a haven of comfort and convenience. Every inch of this property exudes elegance, from the gas log fire casting a warm glow on chilly nights to the ducted heating ensuring year-round comfort. Upstairs, each bedroom is equipped with its own split system, allowing for personalized climate control. Security and privacy are paramount, with a state-of-the-art alarm system safeguarding the premises and a secure off-street double garage providing ample parking space. Indulge in the finest furnishings and finishes, meticulously selected to elevate your living experience. This residence offers the epitome of luxury living. Embrace the lifestyle you deserve. Inspect today to avoid disappointment. **Utilities not included** **Furnished options available and preferred**", "offer": {"@type": "Offer", "priceCurrency": "AUD", "price": "$1650 per week", "url": "https://www.homely.com.au/homes/2-fitzpatrick-street-south-melbourne-vic-3205/13393731", "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock"}, "page_title": "2 Fitzpatrick Street, South Melbourne VIC 3205 - House For Rent", "source_modified_at": "2026-10-01T02:10:52.936Z", "flags": [], "linked_media_count": 18, "selected_media_count": 3, "selection_policy": "all_linked_plans_and_first_gallery_candidates", "gallery_limit": 2, "linked_layout_count": 1}, "image_count": 3}') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET dataset_type=EXCLUDED.dataset_type, name=EXCLUDED.name, city=EXCLUDED.city, region=EXCLUDED.region, address=EXCLUDED.address, source_url=EXCLUDED.source_url, metadata=EXCLUDED.metadata;
